WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.327 --> 00:00:03.494
(bouncy upbeat music)

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:20.220
- Okay, I can do this.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.750
I can...

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.060
Who am I kidding?

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:25.020
I'm out of shape, I'm starving.

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:27.920
I've eaten nothing but
baby birds for a week.

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:29.370
The crunch is nice, sure,

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:31.387
but it don't fill you up.

00:00:31.387 --> 00:00:32.617
(sighing)

00:00:32.617 --> 00:00:34.396
I don't got the strength.

00:00:34.396 --> 00:00:36.820
(sniffing)

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.320
- Oh, really?

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:39.153
- Bacon?

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:42.933
Bite my shiny metal axe!

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:47.690
Well, let's go already!

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:52.690
You took the words and this
tooth right out of my mouth.

00:00:55.981 --> 00:00:58.898
(fast-paced music)

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:04.253
- Ow!

00:01:05.256 --> 00:01:06.460
Bunny!

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:11.460
Ow, ow!

00:01:14.689 --> 00:01:15.882
Ow, ow, ow!

00:01:15.882 --> 00:01:16.790
Ow, ow!

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:17.623
ow!

00:01:19.307 --> 00:01:21.316
(groaning)

00:01:21.316 --> 00:01:23.649
(screaming)

00:01:24.874 --> 00:01:27.207
(shrieking)

00:01:28.696 --> 00:01:31.446
(dramatic music)

00:01:33.048 --> 00:01:36.450
(volcano rumbling)

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:37.330
- This is amazing.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:38.900
Luci, you're a hero.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:40.500
- Yeah, well I dunno about that.

00:01:51.132 --> 00:01:52.132
- Oh my God.

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:55.950
Are you from the future?

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:59.173
- No, I'm from two minutes
ago when you shot me down.

00:02:02.899 --> 00:02:05.982
(lighthearted music)

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:11.810
You built it.

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.363
Science happened.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:20.230
- Oh my God!

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:21.883
We gotta get thrones like this.

00:02:34.906 --> 00:02:37.220
(enchanted music)

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:38.553
Screw this amazing room.

00:02:39.728 --> 00:02:41.711
(door slamming)

00:02:41.711 --> 00:02:42.544
(shrieking)

00:02:42.544 --> 00:02:43.377
- Oh!

00:02:43.377 --> 00:02:44.210
I'll never tell.

00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:45.390
- Okay, well I'm kinda busy,

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:47.270
so--
- She's a bear.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.660
Ursula's a bear!

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.370
- Dad, she's a big lady,

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.400
but--
- No, no,

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.010
no, she's an actual bear.

00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:56.200
She turns into a lady when
she takes her skin off.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:57.033
- Wow.

00:02:58.644 --> 00:02:59.593
(bell ringing)

00:02:59.593 --> 00:03:00.593
- Pardon me.

00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:04.666
(bouncy music)

00:03:22.586 --> 00:03:25.253
(curious music)

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:29.710
- So, you're saying Bean
behaved so disgracefully at

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:33.980
a formal state dinner that
she nearly set off a war?

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:37.330
- No, what Chazz said was
she nearly chazzed off

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:39.240
the whole chazz-ma-tazz.

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.073
Know what I mean?

00:03:40.073 --> 00:03:43.050
- I do not, but let that
be entered into the record.

00:03:43.050 --> 00:03:46.154
- That's Chazz with five "Z's.

00:03:46.154 --> 00:03:47.850
- I think I've done enough court reporting

00:03:47.850 --> 00:03:50.003
to know how to spell, Chazz.

00:03:51.395 --> 00:03:53.003
(sobbing)

00:03:53.003 --> 00:03:54.703
- [Elfo] Bean?

00:03:54.703 --> 00:03:56.060
- Elfo!

00:03:56.060 --> 00:03:57.610
- I knew you could count on me.

00:04:00.861 --> 00:04:04.028
(lighthearted music)

